          </div>
          <h3 class="hp-services__card-title">Web Development</h3>
          <p class="hp-services__card-desc">Custom, high-performance websites built with modern technologies. Mobile-first and blazing fast.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-services__card qf-glass-card qf-reveal">
          <div class="hp-services__icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--qf-accent2)" stroke-width="1.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="M21 21l-4.35-4.35"/><path d="M11 8v6M8 11h6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hp-services__card-title">SEO Optimization</h3>
          <p class="hp-services__card-desc">Dominate search results with data-driven SEO strategies that deliver sustainable organic growth.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-services__card qf-glass-card qf-reveal">
          <div class="hp-services__icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--qf-accent)" stroke-width="1.5"><path d="M18 8A6 6 0 006 8c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.73 21a2 2 0 01-3.46 0"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hp-services__card-title">Social Media Marketing</h3>
          <p class="hp-services__card-desc">Build a powerful brand presence across all major social platforms with strategic campaigns.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-services__card qf-glass-card qf-reveal">
          <div class="hp-services__icon">
            <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--qf-accent2)" stroke-width="1.5"><polygon points="23 7 16 12 23 17 23 7"/><rect x="1" y="5" width="15" height="14" rx="2"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="hp-services__card-title">Video Production</h3>
          <p class="hp-services__card-desc">High-impact video content that showcases your brand, products, and services in stunning detail.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hp-services__card qf-glass-card hp-services__card--new qf-reveal">
          <span class="hp-services__badge">NEW</span>
